        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e25c7c8b-88c0-4ab5-adeb-3583fadf4e6d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour targets for today are linked to firms in the Philippines that offer illegal online gambling services, primarily to the Chinese market.\r\rThey are fugitives using fake names. Their real names are as follows:\rShiela Guo, Wesley Guo, Cassandra Ong, and Alice Guo - the last of whom was the former mayor of a small town in the said country and was accused as a spy.\r\rYou must be very careful in eliminating them as to not tip off groups that are too big for us to handle.",
